              ],
              "content": "Fig. 8.14: A mixture of iron filings and sulfur powder"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_10_image_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.318,
            0.083,
            0.883,
            0.122
          ],
          "content": "Mix them thoroughly in a watch glass. Label this mixture as Sample A (Fig. 8.14)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.319,
            0.126,
            0.542,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": "z Observe it carefully."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.318,
            0.149,
            0.882,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": "z Is this a uniform or a non-uniform mixture? Can you still observe both iron and sulfur as separate substances?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.044,
            0.209,
            0.349,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
